{
  "lineCounts": {
    "Paimon": 2,
    "Player": 25,
    "Qingzhou": 60
  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "2250101",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Qingzhou",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "225010101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "225010101": {
            "id": "225010101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Qingzhou",
            "text": "Hmm... No, this verse will not do. It won't do at all. *sigh* I really must go and see for myself...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225010102"
            ]
          },
          "225010102": {
            "id": "225010102",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Is something the matter?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225010103"
            ]
          },
          "225010103": {
            "id": "225010103",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Qingzhou",
            "text": "How do you fare this day, my liege? My name is Qingzhou. I might add that I consider myself a poet, if I may be so bold.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225010104"
            ]
          },
          "225010104": {
            "id": "225010104",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Qingzhou",
            "text": "By some strange chance, I received a single strain of poetic inspiration of late, but I have yet to find a continuation worthy of its brilliance since...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225010105"
            ]
          },
          "225010105": {
            "id": "225010105",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Qingzhou",
            "text": "Recently, the skies have been strange, and meteorites have fallen in flame to the earth. It is truly a rare sight to see on this mortal plane.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225010106"
            ]
          },
          "225010106": {
            "id": "225010106",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Qingzhou",
            "text": "It came to my mind that if I were to gain some inspiration from observing one such meteorites up close, that next, elusive sentence in my poem may yet surface...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225010107"
            ]
          },
          "225010107": {
            "id": "225010107",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Th—That might not be appropriate...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225010108"
            ]
          },
          "225010108": {
            "id": "225010108",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Qingzhou",
            "text": "Not appropriate? Whatever might you mean by that?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2250102",
      "subQuestName": "Convince Qingzhou to avoid the meteorites",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "225010201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "225010201": {
            "id": "225010201",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Qingzhou",
            "text": "What are you referring to as \"inappropriate\"?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225010202"
            ]
          },
          "225010202": {
            "id": "225010202",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "You'll be knocked unconscious if you touch those meteorites...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225010203"
            ]
          },
          "225010203": {
            "id": "225010203",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Qingzhou",
            "text": "Ah, I've heard tell of this. But if I but observe them up close, nothing untoward will befall me, yes?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225010204"
            ]
          },
          "225010204": {
            "id": "225010204",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Can you guarantee that you won't touch them?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225010205"
            ]
          },
          "225010205": {
            "id": "225010205",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Qingzhou",
            "text": "W—Well, I shall exercise restraint."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2250103",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "225010301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "225010301": {
            "id": "225010301",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "There's a better way to view those meteorites.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225010302"
            ]
          },
          "225010302": {
            "id": "225010302",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Qingzhou",
            "text": "A better way, you say? ...Hmm, you do have a point. If I but gaze into the meteor's flame, but ignore all that surrounds it, would that not be overly narrow of me?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2250104",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "225010401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "225010401": {
            "id": "225010401",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "You can write poetry from here, can't you?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225010402"
            ]
          },
          "225010402": {
            "id": "225010402",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Qingzhou",
            "text": "That simply won't do, my liege. If I stay cloistered and safe all my life, then what would the poems I write be, if not the groans of the healthy, or the pontifications of a fool?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2250106",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "225010601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "225010601": {
            "id": "225010601",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Not everything you write has to shock the world, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225010602"
            ]
          },
          "225010602": {
            "id": "225010602",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Qingzhou",
            "text": "You speak truly — the best verses are divinely inspired, and the finest hands are guided by chance. And yet, this verse has plagued me for far too long. I must continue it somehow..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2250107",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "225010701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "225010701": {
            "id": "225010701",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Will looking at a meteorite really inspire you?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225010702"
            ]
          },
          "225010702": {
            "id": "225010702",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Qingzhou",
            "text": "Ah, you think too little of me, my liege. Were I to gaze upon one, I would surely write you a fine verse."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2250108",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "225010801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "225010801": {
            "id": "225010801",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "But if you were to fall into a slumber...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225010802"
            ]
          },
          "225010802": {
            "id": "225010802",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Qingzhou",
            "text": "Of this you need not fret, my liege. I shall show the utmost restraint. Yet, if the meteorites do indeed consign people to slumber, one wonders what they dream of...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225010803"
            ]
          },
          "225010803": {
            "id": "225010803",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Qingzhou",
            "text": "Yes, how very curious... Ahem! I was merely theorizing. Do not worry, I will not put myself at such a risk."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2250109",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "225010901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "225010901": {
            "id": "225010901",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Are you sure that you can deal with the risks?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225010902"
            ]
          },
          "225010902": {
            "id": "225010902",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Qingzhou",
            "text": "Well, I will bring a guard with me, naturally — just in case.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225010903"
            ]
          },
          "225010903": {
            "id": "225010903",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "It might be difficult to hire someone right now.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225010904"
            ]
          },
          "225010904": {
            "id": "225010904",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Qingzhou",
            "text": "Um... hmm. Yes, that's... You make a good question, my liege."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2250110",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "225011001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "225011001": {
            "id": "225011001",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Inspiration doesn't guarantee good execution.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225011002"
            ]
          },
          "225011002": {
            "id": "225011002",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Qingzhou",
            "text": "Haha, Now, I do not mean to brag, my liege. But though I, Qingzhou, may lack talent, I have still published many a popular verse. You need not worry on my behalf."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2250111",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "225011101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "225011101": {
            "id": "225011101",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Your writing's pretty good already.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225011102"
            ]
          },
          "225011102": {
            "id": "225011102",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Qingzhou",
            "text": "I am unworthy of such praise. But alas, how can a poet live with themselves if they cannot write poetry?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2250124",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "225011901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "225011901": {
            "id": "225011901",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Qingzhou",
            "text": "I have heard your advice, my liege, and I will heed it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225011902"
            ]
          },
          "225011902": {
            "id": "225011902",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Qingzhou",
            "text": "As to whether we should approach the crash site or not, allow me to give it a little more consideration..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2250112",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "225011201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "225011201": {
            "id": "225011201",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Qingzhou",
            "text": "I have given your words much thought, my liege, and valid are your concerns. I shall not risk myself unnecessarily by seeking those meteorites out.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225011202"
            ]
          },
          "225011202": {
            "id": "225011202",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "That's good...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225011203"
            ]
          },
          "225011203": {
            "id": "225011203",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Qingzhou",
            "text": "What's more, a unique stroke does not good poetry make. It is in the many fine details that one's broader quality may be judged.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225011204"
            ]
          },
          "225011204": {
            "id": "225011204",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Qingzhou",
            "text": "We may be able to compose a fine verse from a flower or some other small object. Yet the number of poems written in praise of flora are many indeed...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225011205"
            ]
          },
          "225011205": {
            "id": "225011205",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Qingzhou",
            "text": "Hmm... It is said that outsiders see clearly, yes? Well then, Traveler, what sort of flower do you think I should as reference for composing my poem?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2250113",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "225011301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "225011301": {
            "id": "225011301",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Qingzhou",
            "text": "I have given your words much thought, my liege, but the meteorites are too rare a sight to be missed. I will go nonetheless.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225011302"
            ]
          },
          "225011302": {
            "id": "225011302",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "You...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225011303"
            ]
          },
          "225011303": {
            "id": "225011303",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Qingzhou",
            "text": "But if I were to immediately go close to those meteorites, I fear I might be attracted by them only, thus missing the world around them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225011304"
            ]
          },
          "225011304": {
            "id": "225011304",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Qingzhou",
            "text": "A poet's worst nightmare is to have eyes for one thing only. If I were to merely observe those meteorites, I doubt that anything good should come from my brush.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225011305"
            ]
          },
          "225011305": {
            "id": "225011305",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Qingzhou",
            "text": "So I shall first observe them from afar, taking in the surroundings, before moving in for a closer look...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225011306"
            ]
          },
          "225011306": {
            "id": "225011306",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Qingzhou",
            "text": "And then... Hmm, wait. With so many monsters on the road, and no one to accompany me...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225011307"
            ]
          },
          "225011307": {
            "id": "225011307",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Qingzhou",
            "text": "Traveler, perhaps you might be so kind as to dispose of the monsters that might bar our path?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225011309",
              "225011311"
            ]
          },
          "225011309": {
            "id": "225011309",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Qingzhou",
            "text": "Wonderful! Most splendid! I shall be depending on you, then."
          },
          "225011311": {
            "id": "225011311",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Qingzhou",
            "text": "I—I... Alright, I promise. Come now, why would I put myself in harm's way when I know that touching them may put me in an unending slumber?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225011312"
            ]
          },
          "225011312": {
            "id": "225011312",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Qingzhou",
            "text": "Yet, one wonders what those consigned to such torpor by the meteorites might dream of...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225011313"
            ]
          },
          "225011313": {
            "id": "225011313",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Qingzhou",
            "text": "*coughs* I—I was just joking! Please help me deal with those monsters."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2250116",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "225011401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "225011401": {
            "id": "225011401",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "The Silk Flower, perhaps?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225011402"
            ]
          },
          "225011402": {
            "id": "225011402",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Qingzhou",
            "text": "That seems a fair choice. Even with the skies as they are, the Silk Flowers still bloom as they always have.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225011403"
            ]
          },
          "225011403": {
            "id": "225011403",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Qingzhou",
            "text": "There may be some value in juxtaposing the two...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225011404"
            ]
          },
          "225011404": {
            "id": "225011404",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Qingzhou",
            "text": "Could you gather three Silk Flowers for me, then? Perhaps having the objects close at hand may light my path.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225011405"
            ]
          },
          "225011405": {
            "id": "225011405",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Got it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225011406"
            ]
          },
          "225011406": {
            "id": "225011406",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Qingzhou",
            "text": "You have my utmost thanks, my liege."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2250117",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "225011501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "225011501": {
            "id": "225011501",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Mist Flowers, perhaps?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225011502"
            ]
          },
          "225011502": {
            "id": "225011502",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Qingzhou",
            "text": "Mist Flowers. Hmm... There could be potential in comparing the falling meteorites to Mist Flowers.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225011503"
            ]
          },
          "225011503": {
            "id": "225011503",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Qingzhou",
            "text": "May I ask you to help me gather three Mist Flowers? Perhaps having such objects close at hand may light my path.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225011504"
            ]
          },
          "225011504": {
            "id": "225011504",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Sure.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225011505"
            ]
          },
          "225011505": {
            "id": "225011505",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Qingzhou",
            "text": "You have my utmost thanks, my liege."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2250118",
      "subQuestName": "Pick 3 Silk Flowers",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "225011801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "225011801": {
            "id": "225011801",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Qingzhou",
            "text": "Ah, is this, then, a meteorite? Curious. Most curious...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225011802"
            ]
          },
          "225011802": {
            "id": "225011802",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Don't touch it, now.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225011803"
            ]
          },
          "225011803": {
            "id": "225011803",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Qingzhou",
            "text": "Oh? Ah, it's you, my liege... I am aware of the danger. Please do not worry.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225011804"
            ]
          },
          "225011804": {
            "id": "225011804",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Qingzhou",
            "text": "Thank you for your aid. Please, take this small gift as a token of my esteem.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225011805"
            ]
          },
          "225011805": {
            "id": "225011805",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Qingzhou",
            "text": "This meteorite truly is an enigma... Hmm...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225011806"
            ]
          },
          "225011806": {
            "id": "225011806",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Whoa... He's really into it, isn't he?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225011807"
            ]
          },
          "225011807": {
            "id": "225011807",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Are you sure he heard what we told him? Ugh, Paimon's worried..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2250119",
      "subQuestName": "Pick 3 Mist Flowers",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2250120",
      "subQuestName": "Report back to Qingzhou",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "225012001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "225012001": {
            "id": "225012001",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Qingzhou",
            "text": "Touching a meteorite will see mortals cast into torpid somnolence... I wonder what fantasies unwind before them there?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2250121",
      "subQuestName": "Report back to Qingzhou",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "225012101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "225012101": {
            "id": "225012101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Qingzhou",
            "text": "Haha, it is doubtful that many have written about meteorites and flowers, surely..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2250122",
